an">Sumerian<span class="secs">Legacy</span></a><a href="/culture/mehrgarh-culture">Mehrgarh culture<span class="secs">Exchange</span></a><a href="/culture/oxus-civilisation">Oxus civilisation<span class="secs">Exchange, Summary</span></a><a href="/culture/ubaid-culture">Ubaid culture<span class="secs">Origins, Exchange, Summary</span></a><a href="/empire/saudi-arabia">Saudi Arabia<span class="secs">Summary</span></a><a href="/empire/ur">Ur<span class="secs">Foundation, Socioeconomy, Summary</span></a><a href="/empire/armenian-kingdom-of-cilicia">Armenian Kingdom of Cilicia<span class="secs">Socioeconomy</span></a><a href="/empire/champa">Champa<span class="secs">Impact</span></a><a href="/movement/arab-spring">Arab Spring<span class="secs">Outcomes</span></a><a href="/ideology/pan-arabism">Pan-Arabism<span class="secs">Origins, critiques, Summary</span></a></div></section>
